===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar}} {{term|sc=Arab|حماس|tr=ḥamās|lang=ar}}, an acronym (meaning literally ‘enthusiasm’) for {{Arab|حركة المقاومة الاسلامية}} (ḥarakat al-muqāwama al-islāmīya) ‘Islamic Resistance Movement’.

